#~ "features.\n"
#~ "KOReader currently falls back to hiding all <epub:case> content and shows "
#~ "the <epub:default> content (usually an image).\n"
#~ "This tweak toggles this behavior, and may show the <epub:case> content as "
#~ "plain text."
